# LF in the repository and on every machine, as .editorconfig says. Without this, Git on Windows writes CRLF and a
# local `dotnet format` reports every line (.docs/guides/testing.md#ci).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.docx binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.pptx binary
*.ttf binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
